    "babJudul": "3. Kinematika Gerak Lurus (GLB dan GLBB)",
    "content": "# Rangkuman: 3. Kinematika Gerak Lurus (GLB dan GLBB)\n**Kategori:** TKA Fisika | **Blok:** Blok 1: Mekanika\n\n## Bab 3: Kinematika Gerak Lurus (GLB dan GLBB)\n\n### A. Formula GLB ($a = 0$)\n* $s = v \\cdot t$\n* Papasan: $t = \\frac{S_{\\text{tot}}}{v_A + v_B}$\n* Susulan: $t = \\frac{s_0}{v_B - v_A}$\n\n### B. Formula Utama GLBB ($a = \\text{konstan}$)\n1. $v_t = v_0 + at$\n2. $s = v_0 t + \\frac{1}{2}at^2$\n3. $v_t^2 = v_0^2 + 2as$\n4. $s = \\left(\\frac{v_0 + v_t}{2}\\right)t$\n\n### C. Ringkasan Gerak Vertikal ($g \\approx 10\\text{ m/s}^2$)\n* **Jatuh Bebas ($v_0 = 0$):**\n  $$v_t = \\sqrt{2gh}, \\quad h = \\frac{1}{2}gt^2, \\quad t = \\sqrt{\\frac{2h}{g}}$$\n* **Vertikal ke Atas:**\n  $$t_{\\text{puncak}} = \\frac{v_0}{g}, \\quad h_{\\max} = \\frac{v_0^2}{2g}, \\quad t_{\\text{total}} = \\frac{2v_0}{g}$$\n"
