    "content": "# Rangkuman: 1. Eksponen & Bentuk Akar\n**Kategori:** TKA Matematika Lanjut | **Modul Asal:** 01. Fondasi Aljabar, Persamaan, & Sistem\n\n## 1. Eksponen & Bentuk Akar\n| Sifat / Rumus | Contoh Aplikasi |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| $a^m \\cdot a^n = a^{m+n}$ | $2^3 \\cdot 2^4 = 2^7 = 128$ |\n| $\\frac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n}$ | $\\frac{3^5}{3^2} = 3^3 = 27$ |\n| $(a^m)^n = a^{m \\cdot n}$ | $(2^3)^2 = 2^6 = 64$ |\n| $(a \\cdot b)^n = a^n \\cdot b^n$ | $(2 \\cdot 5)^3 = 2^3 \\cdot 5^3 = 1000$ |\n| $\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^n = \\frac{a^n}{b^n}, \\ b \\neq 0$ | $\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)^3 = \\frac{27}{8}$ |\n| $a^0 = 1, \\ a \\neq 0$ | $7^0 = 1$ |\n| $a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}, \\ a \\neq 0$ | $5^{-2} = \\frac{1}{25}$ |\n| $a^{\\frac{m}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a^m}$ | $8^{\\frac{2}{3}} = \\sqrt[3]{8^2} = 4$ |\n| $p\\sqrt{a} \\pm q\\sqrt{a} = (p \\pm q)\\sqrt{a}$ | $5\\sqrt{3} + 2\\sqrt{3} = 7\\sqrt{3}$ |\n| $\\sqrt{a} \\cdot \\sqrt{b} = \\sqrt{ab}$ | $\\sqrt{2} \\cdot \\sqrt{8} = \\sqrt{16} = 4$ |\n| $\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{50}}{\\sqrt{2}} = \\sqrt{25} = 5$ |\n| $\\frac{c}{\\sqrt{a}} = \\frac{c}{a}\\sqrt{a}$ | $\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{6}{3}\\sqrt{3} = 2\\sqrt{3}$ |\n| $\\frac{c}{\\sqrt{a} \\pm \\sqrt{b}} = \\frac{c(\\sqrt{a} \\mp \\sqrt{b})}{a - b}$ | $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{2(\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3})}{5-3} = \\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3}$ |\n| $\\sqrt{(a+b) \\pm 2\\sqrt{ab}} = \\sqrt{a} \\pm \\sqrt{b} \\ (a > b)$ | $\\sqrt{8 + 2\\sqrt{15}} = \\sqrt{5} + \\sqrt{3}$ |\n| Asimtot Datar $f(x) = a^x$: Garis $y = 0$ | $\\lim_{x \\to -\\infty} 2^x = 0 \\implies \\text{Asimtot datar: } y = 0$ |\n"
