    "content": "# Rangkuman: 2. Logaritma ($^a\\log b = c \\iff a^c = b; \\ a>0, a\\neq 1, b>0$)\n**Kategori:** TKA Matematika Lanjut | **Modul Asal:** 01. Fondasi Aljabar, Persamaan, & Sistem\n\n## 2. Logaritma ($^a\\log b = c \\iff a^c = b; \\ a>0, a\\neq 1, b>0$)\n| Sifat / Rumus | Contoh Aplikasi |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| $^a\\log 1 = 0$ | $^5\\log 1 = 0$ |\n| $^a\\log a = 1$ | $^3\\log 3 = 1$ |\n| $^a\\log(bc) = ^a\\log b + ^a\\log c$ | $^2\\log 24 = ^2\\log 8 + ^2\\log 3 = 3 + ^2\\log 3$ |\n| $^a\\log\\left(\\frac{b}{c}\\right) = ^a\\log b - ^a\\log c$ | $^3\\log 18 - ^3\\log 2 = ^3\\log 9 = 2$ |\n| $^a\\log b^n = n \\cdot ^a\\log b$ | $^2\\log 32 = ^2\\log 2^5 = 5$ |\n| $^{a^m}\\log b^n = \\frac{n}{m} \\cdot ^a\\log b$ | $^{8}\\log 16 = ^{2^3}\\log 2^4 = \\frac{4}{3}$ |\n| $^a\\log b = \\frac{^c\\log b}{^c\\log a} = \\frac{1}{^b\\log a}$ | $^4\\log 5 = \\frac{\\log 5}{\\log 4}; \\ ^2\\log 3 = \\frac{1}{^3\\log 2}$ |\n| $^a\\log b \\cdot ^b\\log c = ^a\\log c$ | $^2\\log 3 \\cdot ^3\\log 8 = ^2\\log 8 = 3$ |\n| $a^{^a\\log b} = b$ | $5^{^5\\log 7} = 7$ |\n| $a^{^c\\log b} = b^{^c\\log a}$ | $2^{^3\\log 5} = 5^{^3\\log 2}$ |\n| Asimtot Tegak $f(x) = ^a\\log x$: Garis $x = 0$ | $f(x) = \\log(x - 3) \\implies \\text{Asimtot tegak: } x = 3$ |\n| Pertidaksamaan ($a > 1$): $^a\\log f(x) > ^a\\log g(x)$ | $^2\\log(x-1) > 2 \\implies x-1 > 4 \\implies x > 5$ |\n| Pertidaksamaan ($0 < a < 1$): tanda berbalik | $^{0.5}\\log x > 1 \\implies 0 < x < 0.5^1 \\implies 0 < x < 0.5$ |\n"
