    "content": "# Rangkuman: 3. Persamaan & Fungsi Kuadrat\n**Kategori:** TKA Matematika Lanjut | **Modul Asal:** 01. Fondasi Aljabar, Persamaan, & Sistem\n\n## 3. Persamaan & Fungsi Kuadrat\n| Sifat / Rumus | Contoh Aplikasi |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| Akar Kuadratik: $x_{1,2} = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{D}}{2a}$ | $x^2 - 4x + 3 = 0 \\implies x_{1,2} = \\frac{4 \\pm \\sqrt{4}}{2} \\implies x = 3 \\lor x = 1$ |\n| Diskriminan: $D = b^2 - 4ac$ | $x^2 - 2x + 5 = 0 \\implies D = (-2)^2 - 4(1)(5) = -16$ |\n| $D > 0 \\implies 2$ akar real berbeda | $x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0 \\ (D = 1) \\implies x_1 = 2, x_2 = 3$ |\n| $D = 0 \\implies 2$ akar real kembar | $x^2 - 6x + 9 = 0 \\ (D = 0) \\implies x_1 = x_2 = 3$ |\n| $D < 0 \\implies$ Tidak ada akar real | $x^2 + x + 2 = 0 \\ (D = -7 < 0)$ |\n| $x_1 + x_2 = -\\frac{b}{a}$ | $2x^2 - 8x + 6 = 0 \\implies x_1 + x_2 = -\\frac{-8}{2} = 4$ |\n| $x_1 \\cdot x_2 = \\frac{c}{a}$ | $2x^2 - 8x + 6 = 0 \\implies x_1 x_2 = \\frac{6}{2} = 3$ |\n| $\\vert x_1 - x_2 \\vert = \\frac{\\sqrt{D}}{\\vert a \\vert}$ | $x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0 \\implies \\vert x_1 - x_2 \\vert = \\frac{\\sqrt{1}}{1} = 1$ |\n| $x_1^2 + x_2^2 = (x_1+x_2)^2 - 2x_1x_2$ | $x_1+x_2=4, x_1x_2=3 \\implies 4^2 - 2(3) = 10$ |\n| Persamaan Baru: $x^2 - (\\alpha+\\beta)x + \\alpha\\beta = 0$ | Akar 2 dan $-4 \\implies x^2 - (-2)x + (-8) = x^2 + 2x - 8 = 0$ |\n| Puncak Parabola: $\\left(-\\frac{b}{2a}, -\\frac{D}{4a}\\right)$ | $y = x^2 - 4x + 1 \\implies x_p = 2, y_p = -3 \\implies (2, -3)$ |\n| Definit Positif: $a > 0 \\land D < 0$ | $f(x) = x^2 + 2x + 3 \\ (a=1>0, D=-8<0) \\implies f(x) > 0, \\forall x$ |\n| Definit Negatif: $a < 0 \\land D < 0$ | $f(x) = -x^2 + 2x - 4 \\ (a=-1<0, D=-12<0) \\implies f(x) < 0, \\forall x$ |\n"
