    "content": "# Rangkuman: 4. Nilai Mutlak & Pertidaksamaan\n**Kategori:** TKA Matematika Lanjut | **Modul Asal:** 01. Fondasi Aljabar, Persamaan, & Sistem\n\n## 4. Nilai Mutlak & Pertidaksamaan\n| Sifat / Rumus                                                             | Contoh Aplikasi                                                                                    |\n| :------------------------------------------------------------------------ | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Definisi: $\\vert x \\vert = x \\ (x \\ge 0); \\ \\vert x \\vert = -x \\ (x < 0)$ | $\\vert 5 \\vert = 5; \\ \\vert -5 \\vert = -(-5) = 5$                                                  |\n| $\\vert f(x) \\vert \\le a \\iff -a \\le f(x) \\le a$                           | $\\vert x - 3 \\vert \\le 2 \\implies -2 \\le x - 3 \\le 2 \\implies 1 \\le x \\le 5$                       |\n| $\\vert f(x) \\vert \\ge a \\iff f(x) \\le -a \\lor f(x) \\ge a$                 | $\\vert 2x - 1 \\vert \\ge 5 \\implies 2x - 1 \\le -5 \\lor 2x - 1 \\ge 5 \\implies x \\le -2 \\lor x \\ge 3$ |\n| $\\vert f(x) \\vert \\le \\vert g(x) \\vert \\iff (f+g)(f-g) \\le 0$             | $\\vert x+1 \\vert \\le \\vert 2x-4 \\vert \\implies (3x-3)(-x+5) \\le 0 \\implies x \\le 1 \\lor x \\ge 5$   |\n| Rasional: $\\frac{P(x)}{Q(x)} \\le 0 \\implies Q(x) \\neq 0$                  | $\\frac{x-1}{x+3} \\le 0 \\implies -3 < x \\le 1$                                                      |\n| Irasional: $\\sqrt{f(x)} < g(x) \\implies f \\ge 0, g > 0, f < g^2$          | $\\sqrt{x-2} < 3 \\implies x \\ge 2 \\land x - 2 < 9 \\implies 2 \\le x < 11$                            |\n"
