    "babIndex": 11,
    "babJudul": "11. Trigonometri Dasar & Analitis",
    "content": "# Rangkuman: 11. Trigonometri Dasar & Analitis\n**Kategori:** TKA Matematika Lanjut | **Modul Asal:** 04. Dimensi Tiga, Transformasi, & Trigonometri\n\n## 11. Trigonometri Dasar & Analitis\n| Sifat / Rumus | Contoh Aplikasi |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| $\\sin^2\\alpha + \\cos^2\\alpha = 1$ | $\\sin\\alpha = \\frac{3}{5} \\implies \\cos\\alpha = \\sqrt{1 - \\frac{9}{25}} = \\frac{4}{5}$ |\n| $1 + \\tan^2\\alpha = \\sec^2\\alpha$ | $\\tan\\alpha = 1 \\implies \\sec^2\\alpha = 2 \\implies \\sec\\alpha = \\sqrt{2}$ |\n| $1 + \\cot^2\\alpha = \\csc^2\\alpha$ | Hubungan identitas kotangen dan kosekan |\n| Kuadran II: $\\sin(180^\\circ - \\alpha) = \\sin\\alpha$ | $\\sin 150^\\circ = \\sin(180^\\circ - 30^\\circ) = \\sin 30^\\circ = \\frac{1}{2}$ |\n| Kuadran III: $\\tan(180^\\circ + \\alpha) = \\tan\\alpha$ | $\\tan 240^\\circ = \\tan(180^\\circ + 60^\\circ) = \\tan 60^\\circ = \\sqrt{3}$ |\n| Kuadran IV: $\\cos(360^\\circ - \\alpha) = \\cos\\alpha$ | $\\cos 315^\\circ = \\cos(360^\\circ - 45^\\circ) = \\cos 45^\\circ = \\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2}$ |\n| Sudut Negatif: $\\sin(-\\alpha) = -\\sin\\alpha$ | $\\sin(-30^\\circ) = -\\sin 30^\\circ = -\\frac{1}{2}$ |\n| Sudut Negatif: $\\cos(-\\alpha) = \\cos\\alpha$ | $\\cos(-60^\\circ) = \\cos 60^\\circ = \\frac{1}{2}$ |\n| Sudut Negatif: $\\tan(-\\alpha) = -\\tan\\alpha$ | $\\tan(-45^\\circ) = -\\tan 45^\\circ = -1$ |\n| Persamaan: $\\sin x = \\sin\\alpha \\implies x = \\alpha + k \\cdot 360^\\circ \\lor (180^\\circ-\\alpha) + k \\cdot 360^\\circ$ | $\\sin x = \\frac{1}{2} \\implies x = 30^\\circ \\lor x = 150^\\circ$ |\n| Persamaan: $\\cos x = \\cos\\alpha \\implies x = \\pm\\alpha + k \\cdot 360^\\circ$ | $\\cos x = \\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2} \\implies x = \\pm 45^\\circ + k \\cdot 360^\\circ$ |\n| Persamaan: $\\tan x = \\tan\\alpha \\implies x = \\alpha + k \\cdot 180^\\circ$ | $\\tan x = \\sqrt{3} \\implies x = 60^\\circ + k \\cdot 180^\\circ$ |\n| Aturan Sinus: $\\frac{a}{\\sin A} = \\frac{b}{\\sin B} = \\frac{c}{\\sin C} = 2R$ | $a = 8, \\angle A = 30^\\circ \\implies 2R = \\frac{8}{0.5} = 16 \\implies R = 8$ |\n| Aturan Cosinus: $a^2 = b^2 + c^2 - 2bc\\cos A$ | $b=3, c=5, \\angle A=60^\\circ \\implies a^2 = 9 + 25 - 2(3)(5)(0.5) = 19$ |\n| Luas Segitiga: $L = \\frac{1}{2}ab\\sin C$ | $a = 4, b = 6, \\angle C = 30^\\circ \\implies L = \\frac{1}{2}(4)(6)(0.5) = 6$ |\n| Luas Segitiga Heron: $L = \\sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)}$ | Menghitung luas dari ketiga panjang sisi ($s = \\frac{a+b+c}{2}$) |\n| $\\sin(\\alpha \\pm \\beta) = \\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta \\pm \\cos\\alpha\\sin\\beta$ | $\\sin 75^\\circ = \\sin(45^\\circ+30^\\circ) = \\frac{\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{2}}{4}$ |\n| $\\cos(\\alpha \\pm \\beta) = \\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta \\mp \\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta$ | $\\cos 75^\\circ = \\cos(45^\\circ+30^\\circ) = \\frac{\\sqrt{6}-\\sqrt{2}}{4}$ |\n| $\\tan(\\alpha \\pm \\beta) = \\frac{\\tan\\alpha \\pm \\tan\\beta}{1 \\mp \\tan\\alpha\\tan\\beta}$ | Rumus penjumlahan tangen sudut |\n| $\\sin 2\\alpha = 2\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\alpha$ | $\\sin\\alpha=0.6, \\cos\\alpha=0.8 \\implies \\sin 2\\alpha = 2(0.6)(0.8) = 0.96$ |\n| $\\cos 2\\alpha = \\cos^2\\alpha - \\sin^2\\alpha = 2\\cos^2\\alpha - 1 = 1 - 2\\sin^2\\alpha$ | Sudut ganda cosinus |\n| $\\tan 2\\alpha = \\frac{2\\tan\\alpha}{1 - \\tan^2\\alpha}$ | Sudut ganda tangen |\n| $\\sin^2\\alpha = \\frac{1 - \\cos 2\\alpha}{2}$ | Mereduksi derajat kuadrat ke sudut linear |\n| $\\cos^2\\alpha = \\frac{1 + \\cos 2\\alpha}{2}$ | Mereduksi derajat kuadrat cosinus |\n| $2\\sin\\alpha\\cos\\beta = \\sin(\\alpha+\\beta) + \\sin(\\alpha-\\beta)$ | Perkalian sinus-cosinus ke bentuk penjumlahan |\n| $2\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta = \\cos(\\alpha+\\beta) + \\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)$ | Perkalian dua cosinus ke penjumlahan cosinus |\n| $-2\\sin\\alpha\\sin\\beta = \\cos(\\alpha+\\beta) - \\cos(\\alpha-\\beta)$ | Perkalian dua sinus ke selisih cosinus |\n| $\\sin A + \\sin B = 2\\sin\\frac{A+B}{2}\\cos\\frac{A-B}{2}$ | Penjumlahan sinus ke perkalian |\n| $\\cos A - \\cos B = -2\\sin\\frac{A+B}{2}\\sin\\frac{A-B}{2}$ | Selisih cosinus ke perkalian dua sinus |\n| $a\\cos x + b\\sin x = k\\cos(x - \\alpha)$ | $k = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}, \\ \\tan\\alpha = \\frac{b}{a}$ |\n"
